        "description": {
            "value": "<p>You call forth a divine cataclysm from your deity, destroying living and undead creatures in the area alike. Creatures in the area take 10d6 void damage and 10d6 spirit damage. A creature harmed by vitality damage, such as one with void healing, takes vitality damage instead of void damage from this spell.</p>\n<p>@Damage[(@item.level+2)d6[void],(@item.level+2)d6[spirit]|traits:spirit]{Leveled Void + Spirit Damage}</p>\n<p>@Damage[(@item.level+2)d6[vitality],(@item.level+2)d6[spirit]|traits:spirit]{Leveled Vitality + Spirit Damage}</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d6 void damage and 1d6 spirit damage.</p>"
